{"v":3,"catch":"冒險家亞特魯，航向遙遠的北方大海！","desc":"一般版內容：\n・《伊蘇X -北境歷險-》\n\n※本產品為「一般版」。另有「數位豪華版」可供選購。請留意勿重複購買。\n\n【遊戲簡介】\n本作舞台位於分佈著無數大小島嶼的北方海域「奧貝利亞灣」。\n年輕冒險家亞特魯・克里斯汀在該處邂逅了海洋民族「諾曼」，而在當地襲擊人們的不死亡靈「古里格」究竟是什麼……？ \n駕駛帆船行駛在大海上，以海圖作為線索探索廣大的海域！有時還會與敵船進行海戰……\n本作乃是以追求「冒險樂趣」為號召的伊蘇系列最新作。\n\n年輕時的冒險家亞特魯・克里斯汀在北境之海「奧貝利亞灣」的全新冒險即將展開！","publisher":"Clouded Leopard Entertainment","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["動作","角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 6.9GB / Switch 6.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5a1b9fac9b0c71d2182210e96714c4a1af30fa76daf52c0c6a169371a8507756.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3414d417f74b8cd0f57ea3baa9109e41fbab637169f0d0b81a39272b50f2667d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/acc33afaa631322cd687dd45e12f3ec2bbcf4e478cf4147f283b94b0b74728b0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bb1016cd0890f85696abf4bbf2ee178a362efaaf894dbfa2eaf16ea2c3d82914.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fab2b993ddbd38e2f2bc5bbc636f51efb298f185797468bdf5859f6ac0f4a16a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eb5a684c46b6a05a70499a4808d62a98080e719148351680c462894149265f14.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a0c01bed8000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000043133","name":"夏日冒險","img":"e40ce5f4bf77ac507a3cface8d3dbb25edaeda3bace6151c05335a17cab83e32","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000043134","name":"碧藍美人魚","img":"1ddfb69b617ab4340265b630addab032849dac39930ea908b619c883319eb1ab","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000043136","name":"無盡旅程","img":"6a54142e4627672431b5d9aede2758a7be16bae624c4e7b00122fc43506b5257","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000043137","name":"英勇女船長","img":"5667aedd1bbd330de59b24a75e625200fd06cf8f90658a99fe22ffb7cc96fd87","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000043139","name":"聖獸「露」變裝套組","img":"f6e43e90534ade72a34de3d7e3c4393a7c92e0bfe51fb61fffbec7f8b815b7bc","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000043140","name":"護目裝飾套組·酷